Emoji assets
============

emoji/<category>/<codepoints>.png
---------------------------------
3,606 emoji images (64x64 PNG) extracted from Telegram's emoji.pack for Android
(EPK3 pack, https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram). They are grouped into Telegram's eight
categories: smileys, nature, food, activity, travel, objects, symbols, flags.

The artwork originates from Apple's emoji set as shipped by Telegram. Telegram's source
is GPLv2+; the emoji artwork itself is not covered by a permissive license. Using these
images in this project means the project must comply with those terms.

Changing an emoji: simply replace the PNG with any 64x64 image (same file name) and
rebuild. INDEX.csv lists folder/file/keywords so you can locate one quickly.

emoji_names.json
----------------
Emoji name/keyword index (character -> searchable keywords) used by the picker search,
generated from the iamcal/emoji-data project (MIT-licensed data).
